  "changelog": "Initial release of world-builder (v1.0.0):\n\n- Adds a comprehensive world-building skill supporting two modes: independent generation (from concepts) and character extraction (from Character Builder skills).\n- Implements a 12-dimensional, three-layer orthogonal model (\u5b9e\u4f53\u5c42, \u793e\u4f1a\u5c42, \u62bd\u8c61\u5c42) to structure and fill all aspects of a fictional world.\n- Integrates with meta-skill-system pipeline, including three-axis evaluation, domain calibration, workflow orchestration, and fallback modes.\n- Provides robust input parsing, task routing, and strict fact/modeling rules to ensure consistency and logical coherence.\n- Supports partial/worldwide generation, prompt export, and downgrade modes for offline or limited-interaction scenarios.",
